28)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 跳段街舞 ጿ ኈ ቼ ዽ ጿ ኈ ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3453246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="rorrErD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3453246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" >rorrErD</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 面包先生可以怎么吃呢（乙烯语气）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="RainTree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" >RainTree</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 新款星空主题<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-452">面包先生</a>上市了，W博士的新作，十站员工尊享半价，买二赠一等惊喜优惠！订购电话：████████——[该用户已██]<br /> <br /> <br /> RE:[楼上]<br /> 楼上因非法宣传广告而被Darry逮捕，但是其成功 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">越狱</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">生还</span> 逃跑，推测其仍在 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">传销</span> 宣传推销。——[该用户已██]<br /> <br /> <br /> 楼上虚假宣传！这是赤裸裸的诈骗！——<span style="color: #0645ad">agfarmer</span><br /> <br /> <br /> RE:<span style="color: #0645ad">agfarmer</span><br /> 随便偷人家CSS的小偷也好意思说这种话吗？——全体farmer特工们<br /> <br /> <br /> Darry你好，我是电池，很高兴能让我来十站群。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guo-mu-ye" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126600&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="Guo_Mu_Ye" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126600)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/guo-mu-ye" >Guo_Mu_Ye</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 默默看看Darry的主页～话说这源代码看的我真的脑瓜疼啊——<span style="color: #0645ad">Drsalted fish</span><br /> <br /> <br /> 呐，在写了在写了，呐——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" >Dr Aurora Owl</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 租个肝，600一个月，成？——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150792&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="HigashikataJosuke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150792)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" >HigashikataJosuke</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 加油，Bro——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 让我往你的脸上涂满巧克力酱，洒满糖豆子，你就是整条街最靓的面包——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5721026&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="Vodka Wells" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5721026)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" >Vodka Wells</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 众所周知，Darry经常被紧急调到Site-CN-21，担任站长。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="Confucian Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" >Confucian Lee</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> Darry好！感谢你让我进10站群<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">当屑</span>生草。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-destroyerplantard" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6516148&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="Dr DestroyerPlantard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6516148)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-destroyerplantard" >Dr DestroyerPlantard</a></span></p> <p>我立志为10站的建设添一根小稻草！（字体不错，收下了）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916406" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span></p> <div style="border-top: 1px solid #C8C8C8; border-bottom: 1px solid #C8C8C8;"> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;"><strong>主题：</strong>站点项目自查 | <strong>地点：</strong>科隆</span></p> </div> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://darry.wikidot.com/local--files/darry16/cologne-1846338_1280.jpg" alt="cologne-1846338_1280.jpg" class="image" /></div> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong><tt><span style="color: green">Safe</span></tt></strong></span></p> <hr /> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong><tt><span style="color: orange">Euclid</span></tt></strong></span></p> <hr /> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong><tt><span style="color: red">Ke