						 <p><strong>示例：</strong></p> <div class="parapost reply0"> <p><span style="color: green"><strong>somedude</strong></span> 10/20/15 (TUE) 18:21:54 #65410813</p> <hr /> <p>观者如山色沮丧，谬上丹墀为近臣。维摩丈室空翛然，基在小故曰阴基。论功还欲请长缨，坛上夜半东方明。组练三千夹将坛，件安才子太微仙。乱山遮隔无重数，数首风流似玉台。文吏何曾重刀笔……</p> </div> <div class="parapost reply1"> <p><span style="color: cyan"><strong>🗿 jlessthan</strong></span> 10/20/15 (TUE) 19:07:14 #65412825</p> <hr /> <p>阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴。</p> <p>管理停止命令。</p> </div> <div class="parapost reply2"> <p><span style="color: green"><strong>somedude</strong></span> 10/20/15 (TUE) 18:23:30 #65410841</p> <hr /> <p>对不起</p> </div> <p><strong>用法：</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:component:parawatch-forum-post</span></span><br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;color</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">这里填颜色名字或者#rrggbb</span> |<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;username</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">人物账户名</span> | ← 若为版主则带有“🗿 ”前缀<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;date</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">月/日/年 (周) 时:分:秒</span> | ← 周指这天周几，三个大写字母<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;postno</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">8位数</span> | ← 应随发帖时间增长<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;depth</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">0/1/2/3/4……</span> | ← 该帖递进多少层<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;content</span></span>=<span style="color: lightgreen">实际论坛帖文在此。</span> ← 若跨越了多行，每一行结尾必须有空格<br /> <span style="color: lightblue"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></span></p> </blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;">（结果）</p> <div class="parapost reply0"> <p><span style="color: red"><strong>人物账户名</strong></span> 月/日/年 (周) 时:分:秒 #8位数</p> <hr /> <p>实际论坛帖文在此。</p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4915183&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606916411" alt="hoah2333" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4915183)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" >hoah2333</a></span></p> 
